    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">The specific form is in lines 107-109 of here: <a href=\"https://github.com/stan-dev/math/blob/develop/stan/math/prim/mat/prob/lkj_corr_lpdf.hpp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/stan-dev/math/blob/develop/stan/math/prim/mat/prob/lkj_corr_lpdf.hpp&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792443459743000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0yBpfBxgEiOAtz11rZyTUo\">https://github.com/stan-dev/math/blob/develop/stan/math/prim/mat/prob/lkj_corr_lpdf.hpp</a><div><br></div><div>(You don&#39;t need the normalizing constant unless you&#39;re going to compute a marginal likelihood)</div></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div></div>"
