   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Actually, it&#39;s easier than that.  R code for log-prior (up to a constant) is <div><br></div><div>log_prior = (eta-1) * determinant(sigma, logarithm=TRUE)</div><div><br></div><div>which should be easy to wrap into the rgeneric framework.</div></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     2,
     "<div class=\"gmail_extra\"><div class=\"gmail_quote\">On 6 April 2018 at 13:35, Daniel Simpson <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">dp.si...@gmail.com</a>&gt;</span> wrote:<br></div></div>"
